    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Barren River stretches 135 miles, making it a significant tributary of Kentucky’s Green River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barren_River"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "It rises near the Tennessee border in Monroe County and empties into the Green River in Warren County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barren_River"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Tailwater Recreation Area sits just below Barren River Lake Dam, near the historic ford where bison and Native Americans crossed for centuries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
